{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"foundry","model_identifier":"foundry","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# foundry\n\nFoundry: a brick hall with a tall chimney, a glowing casting pit in the floor (seen through the wide door), and a finished cannon barrel resting on blocks outside.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 9 columns (192 x 144 units, 5.40 x 4.05 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -70..70, y 0..236, z -66..90 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 66, construction_0 28, construction_33 49, construction_66 80, ruined 60 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 128 x 168 x 88 centred at x 0, z 20\n- chimney: 24 x 236 x 24 at x 48, z 76\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `foundry_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `foundry_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_foundry` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 6.0 | loop | `crane` jib swings slowly. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -33)\n- `fx_smoke` at (48, 238, 76)\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 8, 5)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -30)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (44, 0, -40)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hall_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-66.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[66.0,3.0,66.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,408.0,132.0,411.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[132.0,408.0,224.0,411.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,408.0,132.0,411.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[132.0,408.0,224.0,411.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[298.0,0.0,430.0,92.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[298.0,0.0,430.0,92.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"6def1fa5-e5b4-50f8-b0f2-2888e978eb3c"},{"name":"hall_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,3.0,-24.0],"to":[64.0,103.0,-20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[70.0,0.0,198.0,100.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[278.0,0.0,282.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[70.0,0.0,198.0,100.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[278.0,0.0,282.0,100.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[135.0,394.0,263.0,398.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[135.0,394.0,263.0,398.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"38e8db02-fcaa-502d-8183-e27cdce3073b"},{"name":"hall_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,3.0,60.0],"to":[64.0,103.0,64.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[70.0,0.0,198.0,100.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[282.0,0.0,286.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[70.0,0.0,198.0,100.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[282.0,0.0,286.0,100.0],"text